---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Chinese Mountains Website" description="How Chinese Mountains handles your data: what analytics we collect, what we never collect, how cookies work on this site, and your privacy choices explained.">
<section class="pt-12 pb-20">
<div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6" style="max-width:48rem">
<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 text-sm">Last updated: August 4, 2026</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">What We Collect</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><strong>We keep data collection to a minimum.</strong> Chinese Mountains is a static website without user accounts. We run privacy-respecting aggregate analytics and no advertising. Here's what we do collect:</p>
<ul class="space-y-2 mt-3 text-slate-600">
<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&bull;</span><strong>Email (if you contact us):</strong> If you email us at hello@chinese-mountains.com, we receive your email address and whatever information you include in your message. We use this only to reply to you and never share it with anyone.</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">We load a small number of third-party resources on our pages:</p>
<ul class="space-y-2 mt-3 text-slate-600">
<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&bull;</span><strong>Google Analytics 4 (anonymized):</strong> We collect aggregate usage analytics — pages viewed, referrer, country, and device type — to understand which guides are useful. We do not run advertising, and we do not sell or share analytics data.</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&bull;</span><strong>Map tiles (via CartoDB):</strong> Our interactive maps fetch background tiles from CartoDB, which may log standard request data in server logs.</li>
</ul>
<p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Fonts and map styles are served directly from our own domain, and we do not run advertising pixels or social-media trackers. The analytics above are the only tracking on this site.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Your Rights</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Since we store no personal data (except emails you voluntarily send us), there's not much to exercise rights over. If you've emailed us and want your correspondence deleted, just reply and ask — we'll delete it immediately.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">If we ever add analytics, advertising, or user accounts, we'll update this page and note the changes clearly. The current version will always be at this URL.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Contact</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:hello@chinese-mountains.com" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">hello@chinese-mountains.com</a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
